am-semnat-expo-sdk
Copyright 2026 am-semnat contributors

This Expo module contains no vendored third-party source. It wraps the
am-semnat iOS and Android SDKs at runtime — those SDKs in turn link
third-party code (OpenSSL on iOS, JMRTD / SCUBA / BouncyCastle on Android)
whose attribution obligations are documented in:

- am-semnat-ios-sdk:    ios/NOTICE, ios/LICENSE-THIRD-PARTY, ios/ATTRIBUTION.md
- am-semnat-android-sdk: android/NOTICE, android/LICENSE-THIRD-PARTY, android/ATTRIBUTION.md

Consumer apps must reproduce the third-party notices from those sibling
SDKs — bundling this Expo package does not replace that obligation.
